+Quaternal Logic holds how a whole differentiates without ceasing to be whole and how differentiated beings remain related to what exceeds their present determination. Self and Other can enter wider co-internality without one absorbing the other or a super-agent claiming their ground. An internality belongs to containing worlds, communities and ecologies; transcendence here opens relation through those wholes, rather than installing an absolute exterior which the situated inquiry could inspect from nowhere.
+
+The whole **L5 Para Vāk × L0′ Archetypal-Numerical** pair gives two complementary disclosures. Anuttara/Asambhava, Para Vāk, Paśyantī, Madhyamā, Vaikharī and Mātṛkā carry the movement from prior-to-determination through word/power, vision, inner and expressed articulation to the differentiating matrix of signs. Unity, Duality, Triad, Quaternity, Pentad and Hexad carry the horizontal articulation of difference, mediation, structured field, developed relation and articulated whole. The product’s exact mathematical work is the native derivation already earned in §3, including both Spanda readings and their musical and topological returns; the pair does not substitute a six-word ladder for that work.
+
+MEF has both its maintained name, **Meta-Epistemic Framework**, and its operative work of making differently situated epistemic refractions explicit. The complete two-lens reading of each product is required; one lens-name or a generic all-cells overlay cannot disclose it. A Ref preserves whose internality, relation and meaning it addresses. A primitive remains alive when its generating relation stays operable: what it relates, what difference it makes, how that difference becomes actual and what returns from the encounter.
+
+**E3 — Lens refraction:** represent the same problem through multiple declared MEF lenses and measure whether divergences become more legible.
+
+**E5 — QL recursion:** test whether sixfold QL units can nest fractally without loss of provenance or uncontrolled context growth.
+
+These two vectors compose with E1, E2, E4 and E6 in Actuation and their Central, AIKit, Factory and Workcell returns. They remain six discriminating research operations, no longer six competing subsection titles. S returns the six product aspects as one World/Life field; A/C keeps their constitutional and ethical ruling. The next station asks what institution and instrument can sustain this relation without owning its ground.
+
